    "notes": "English version of \"Ur Trollkarlens Hatt\".\nComes in a fully laminated single sleeve and a neutral white polylined innersleeve with 4912 000 1243.4 N 35/73 print.\n\nSome issues may come with sticker on rear cover with a different CatNo 206 905-270 (over the original CatNo; identical release with same runouts, labels etc). These copies with Ariola cat nos. do not appear prior to 01/1985 when the Charisma label was purchased by Virgin Records.\n\n[On back cover]:\nPrinted in Germany\n\n[On labels]:\nMade in Germany",
    "released_formatted": "1973",
